        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MP70, Large Manhattan Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 7 Inch Manhattan Cabinet Pull is available in an wide array of finish colors. Its modern elegance makes it a great choice for swanky home remodels. The Large Manhattan Cabinet Door Pull comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP70-specifications.gif?v=1704354736\" width=\"514\" height=\"216\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MP70 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-manhattan-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp40\"><b>Deltana MP40 4\" Manhattan Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP70-installed.jpg?v=1704354735\" width=\"291\" height=\"218\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana MP70 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Manhattan Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 7-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount: 21/32\" square</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP70-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Deltana MP70 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
